{
  "key": 18239,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000575_00000",
      "en_US": "Yahoo!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000575_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "I got something cool.\n",
        "I’ll show you as a special favor!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000575_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh?\n",
        "What the...\r",
        "What’s this all about?\r",
        "...I got some Seals, but I forgot to\n",
        "put them on.\r",
        "Oh, right.\n",
        "It’s because I was at the ruins.\r",
        "The ruins here are cool.\n",
        "You have to check it out.\r",
        "I even found a Hidden Machine.\n",
        "It was Defog!\r",
        "Anyway, I’ll battle you another time.\n",
        "See ya!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000575_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Breathing in this refreshing air...\n",
        "It perks up Pokémon, don’t you think?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000575_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Howdy, traveling Trainer.\n",
        "Take it easy, slow, and casual."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000575_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Howdy, traveling Trainer.\n",
        "There’s nothing here.\r",
        "Well, nothing but plenty of time to\n",
        "think, anyway.\r",
        "Oh, right. We have the ruins here.\n",
        "Why not take a tour through that?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000575_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m too little, so I don’t know\n",
        "how to battle very good.\r",
        "The nice Day-Care Lady is raising\n",
        "my Pokémon for me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000575_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Every Sunday, I visit the Lost\n",
        "Tower..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000575_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "There used to be nothing here but\n",
        "a road that went straight through.\r",
        "Over time, Pokémon and people just\n",
        "gathered, and the town came to be."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000575_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "A traveling Trainer, huh?\r",
        "Tell me, how many kinds of Pokémon\n",
        "have you met so far?\r",
        "If you’re a competent Trainer, I’d\n",
        "think you’d’ve met at least fifty.\r",
        "If you haven’t, go farther abroad and\n",
        "search wider, youngster."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000575_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Your encounters with Pokémon can\n",
        "be considered your shared history.\r",
        "This here’s a Pokétch app called\n",
        "Pokémon History.\r",
        "Use it to see your history of\n",
        "Pokémon catches.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000575_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "You have your history, and each\n",
        "Pokémon has its own history.\r",
        "When the two collide, new drama\n",
        "is born."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000575_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Solaceon Town\n",
        "Free of Worry!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000575_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon Day Care\n",
        "Let Us Raise Your Pokémon"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000575_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon News Press\n",
        "Wanted: Pro Pokémon Catcher!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2WallPhotos",
      "en_US": [
        "A wall of photos. Each card has a\n",
        "name, a date and a place."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2WallPonyta",
      "en_US": [
        "A child's drawing of a man and a\n",
        "Ponyta.\r",
        "The card gives her name, her\n",
        "birthday, and where it happened."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2WallElias",
      "en_US": [
        "A card: ELIAS. VALOR BASIN.\r",
        "No one signed for it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2WallBanner",
      "en_US": [
        "A banner, pinned above the wall:\r",
        "WHO DID YOU LOSE?\n",
        "Team Eclipse"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2WallTeo",
      "en_US": [
        "A new card: TEO. A boy, smiling.\n",
        "The pin is still shiny."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2IndraAnotherName",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: Another name today.\n",
        "A boy from Floaroma.\r",
        "His dad cried the whole time.\n",
        "I wrote it all down anyway.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2IndraSomebodyHasTo",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: Somebody has to.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2IndraMorningDoor",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: Saros wants a morning.\n",
        "Kahn wants a door.\r",
        "I don't care which one works, Teo.\r",
        "Either one brings you home.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2IndraHandsShake",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: Saros's hands shake now.\n",
        "Kahn doesn't sleep.\r",
        "The shards are taking something\n",
        "out of them.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2IndraKeepTheDoor",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: So I keep the door.\r",
        "Nobody gets through who could\n",
        "break it.\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
